ric calculator, I calculate the base score to be **8.5**.\n\nHere is the output in JSON format:\n```json\n{\n  \"attack_vector\": \"A\",\n  \"attack_complexity\": \"L\",\n  \"privileges_required\": \"H\",\n  \"user_interaction\": \"N\",\n  \"scope\": \"U\",\n  \"confidentiality_impact\": \"H\",\n  \"integrity_impact\": \"H\",\n  \"availability_impact\": \"L\",\n  \"vector_string\": \"CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:H/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:L\",\n  \"base_score\": 8.5\n}\n```\nNote that the output is a single JSON object, as per the requirements.",
